      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Partner projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everybody's worst nightmare.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Way worse when you don't have anyone to partner with except for the one person you literally never talk to. And, you know, you maybe, kinda, sort of have a crush on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Catradora class project fic&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
